      "title": "Deduction in respect of contributions given by companies to political parties.",
      "text": "For the purposes of this section, the term \"contribute\", with its grammatical variations and cognate expressions shall have the same meaning as assigned to it in section 182 of the Companies Act, 2013 (18 of 2013).",
